Language English

Book Chapel Ordered No Keep Looped

	Page Place
		Triggered By @PlaceChapel
		
		Remove TokenExploreChapelViaLibrary
		Add TileChapel, TokenChapelTrapdoor!
		
		Text """
			Opening the door, you step into the opening of a long tunnel. It's
			so dark that you find yourself feeling your way along the smooth
			stone walls. Eventually, you come to a staircase that leads to a
			door on the ceiling. When you open it, you find yourself in an
			old--but well-maintained--chapel. In the distance, through one of
			the windows, you can see the house you are supposed to be cleaning.
			Place the {c:TileChapel} tile and trap door as indicated, then
			discard this Explore token.
		"""
		
		$mythosChapel = true
		
		exploredChapel = true
		wandererInLibrary = false
	End Page Place
	
	Page PlaceExploreOutside
		Add TokenChapelEscapeViaChapelLocked!
	
		Text """
			Across the room is a door to the outside. Place an Explore token as
			indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceExploreOutside
	
	Page PlaceExploreCryptViaChapel
		// if we already have the explore token down, just quietly replace it
		If Not exploredCrypt Then Add TokenExploreCryptViaChapel!
		If exploredCrypt Then Add TokenExploreCryptViaChapel
		Remove TokenExploreChapelViaCrypt
		
		Text """
			Across the room is another door. Place an Explore token as
			indicated.
		"""
		
		if exploredCrypt Then Text """
			Across the room is another door. <<Maybe this is the door we found
			in the crypt?>> you say out loud.
		"""		
	End Page PlaceExploreCryptViaChapel
	
	Page PlaceWhiskey
		Add TokenSearchChapelWhiskey!
		
		Text """
			Like the house, this place is a mess. You wonder if this would have
			gbeen part of the cleaning contract. If it had been real.

			There's a bottle lying on one of the pews. Place a Search token as
			indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceWhiskey
	
	Page PlaceSearchRitualComponents
		Add TokenSearchChapelRitualComponents!
		
		Text """
			A ceremonial table sits at the front of the room. There is a
			large book and various religousm icons and implements. Place a
			Search token as indicated.
		""
	
		Trigger @MoveAfterExplore
	End Page PlaceSearchRitualComponents
	
	Page ExploreChapelEscapeLocked
		Triggered By @ExploreChapelEscapeLocked
		
		Remove TokenExploreEscapeViaChapelLocked
		
		Text """
			The door is locked. You could probably break it down, but you still
			have work to do. Reluctantly, you turn away from the door. Discard
			this Explore token.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page ExploreChapelEscepLocked
	
	Page SearchRitualComponents
		Triggered By @SearchChapelRitualComponents
		
		Prolog """
			You walk over to the altar. There is a large book set out on it.
		"""
		Button "Search"
		
		Remove TokenSearchChapelRitualComponents
		
		Text """
			As you walk around the altar to get a better look, you see that
			there is a chalice, some herbs, and even a skull. As you prepare to
			tuck the skull in your bag, you reflect on the many times you've
			been in these situations. You've learned to shamelessly grab
			anything you might need, no matter how unlikely. Gain the
			{c:QItemRitualComponents} Unique Item.

			The book is the Smythe family bible. The first section lists
			births, marriages, and deaths going back many generations. Some
			of the men's names have a symbol next to them: {success}. They all
			have the last name Smythe. {c:EventChosenInvestigaor}'s cousin David
			has this marking. You aren't sure what it means, but from what
			you've seen and read today, it worries you.
				
			Gain 2 {clue}, then discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		foundRitualComponents = true
		Exit
	End Page SearchRitualComponents
	
	Page SearchWhiskey
		Triggered By @SearchChapelWhiskey
		
		Prolog """
			There’s a liquor bottle here. Someone has picked at the edges of the
			label. It’s about half-full.
		"""
		Button "Pick it up"
		
		Remove TokenSearchChapelWhiskey
		
		Text """
			You bend down to pick it up and causually smell the bottle. Man,
			that is some good whiskey! Gain the {c:QItemWhiskey} Common Item,
			then discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		$mythosMinor = true
	End Page SearchWhiskey
	
	Page SearchWhiskeyNoise
		Add TokenChapelPriestAlive!
		
		Text """
			While you are bent over getting the bottle, you don’t notice the
			chapel door swing open and a priest walk in. Without looking around,
			he turns and heads for a door on the other side of the room. 

			As you stand up, pleased with your find, you catch your shirt on the
			pew, trip, and fall to the ground. When you hit the floor, you 
			let out a loud curse.

			The priest turns, his face turning from startled to angry. "Who are
			you and how did you get in here?"
			
			Place the White Man token as indicated.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page SearchWhiskeyNoise
	
	Page TalkToPriest
		@Triggered By @TalkToChapelPriest
		
		Prolog "The priest glares at you expectantly. You reply..."
		
		Button "<<What are <i>you</i> doing here?!" Set response
		Button "<<I'm with a cleaning service and I got lost." Set response
		Button "In for a penny, in for a pound: kill him." Set response
	End Page TalkToPriest
	
	Page ChallengePriest
		Visible When response = 1
		Remove TokenChapelPriestAlive
		Spawn CustomMonsterChapelRiot!
		
		Text """
			<<What am <i>I</i> doing here? I’m a priest; this is my chapel. It’s
			not a place for impertinent criminals.>> He turns toward the door
			and yells, <<Boys!>> Several men in robes run through the door.
			<<They do not belong here. Take care of them.>> The men turn toward
			you and your stomach sinks.

			Replace the White Man token with a {c:CustomMonsterChapelRiot}.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page ChallengePriest
	
	Page LieToPriest
		Visible When response = 2
		
		Remove TokenChapelPriest
		
		Text """
			<<Oh,>> the priest brightens. <<Benjamin told me you’d be here
			today. I’m not sure how you found this place, but you should head
			back to the house and get to work. We need that place cleaned up.
			I’ll remind the boys that you’re here at Benjamin’s request.>> The
			priest turns and walks out of the room, leaving you puzzled at all
			of this.
			
			Discard the White Man token.
			
			As you ponder, you look down and see that the priest has dropped
			something. Wrapped in cloth is an ornate knife. Gain the 
			{c:QItemRitualDagger} Common Item.

			<<Haunted house, murdered kids, and now what looks like some local
			cult," you mutter to yourself. <<What have I gotten myself into?>>		
		"""
		
		wandererFrequency = wandererFrequency + 2
		foundRitualDagger = true
		
		Goto PlaceAfterPriest
	End Page LieToPriest
	
	Page KillPriest
		Visible When response = 3
		
		Remove TokenChapelPriestAlive
		Add QItemRitualDagger!
		
		Text """
			You cock your arm to punch the priest and he raises his arms in
			defense. As he does, a knife falls out of his robe. Place the
			{c:QItemRitualDagger} Common Item in the priest’s space.

			You punch hard through his waving arms and strike him in the temple.
			The man falls back, hitting his head on the corner of a pew. He 
			collapses, seizes for a moment, and then goes still. He’s dead.
			Take 1 facedown Horror.

			<<A haunted house, dead kids, and now a local cult,>> you mutter to
			yourself. <<I should get out of here before someone finds his
			body.>>

			Discard the White Man token.
		"""
		
		chapelPriestDead = 1
		wandererMax = wandererMax + 1
		If wandererMax > 6 Then WandererMax = 6
		wandererFrequency = wandererFrequency - 1
		Goto PlaceAfterPriest
	End Page KillPriest

	Page PlaceAfterPriest
		Remove TokenExploreChapelViaCrypt
		Add TokenExploreCryptviaChapel!
		
		Text """
			You wonder what the priest was up to when he walked in. Place a
			Search token as indicated.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page
	
	Page DefeatRiot
		Trigged By @DefeatCustomMonsterChapelRiot
		
		Add TokenSearchRitualDagger!
		
		Text """
			The priest and his men lie dead at your feet, their blood seeping
			into the wooden floor. Place the White Man token as indicated.
			
			<<A haunted house, dead kids, and now a local cult,>> you mutter to
			yourself. <<I should get out of here before someone finds these
			bodies.>>
		"""
		
		chapelPriestDead = 1
		wandererMax = wandererMax + 1
		If wandererMax > 6 Then WandererMax = 6
		wandererFrequency = wandererFrequency - 1
		Goto PlaceAfterPriest
	End Page
	
	Page SearchRitualDagger
		Triggered By @SearchChapelRitualDagger When Not Read
		
		Prolog "The priest lies dead on the floor in front of you."
		Button "Make sure he's dead"
		
		Text """
			You step a bit closer and touch the body lightly with your foot.
			
			Nothing.
			
			With more confidence, you kick the body and it rolls limply off
			its side. As it rolls, the priests robes fall open, revealing an
			ornate knife wrapped in cloth. Gain the {c:QItemRitualDagger}
			Common Item.
		"""
	End Page SearchRitualDagger
	
	Page SearchRitualDaggerAfter
		Triggered By @SearchChapelRitualDagger When SearchRitualDagger Is Read	
		
		Text """
			You should probably leave the dead priest alone and get on with it.
		"""
	End Page SearchRitualDaggerAfter
	
	Page ExploreCryptViaChapel
		Prolog """
			When you look closer, you see there is a keyhole. An investigator
			in the {c:TileChapel} who has the {c:QItemKey} can open this door.
		"""
		Button "Open the door"
		
		Text """
			After unlocking it, the door opens into a dank cave of some kind.???
		"""
	
	End Page
End Book Chapel